R-RG9 R-RG2 R-RG1 R-FL4 R-J3 R-DI14 (slice 225, Design Q601, entry commands): the built-in default does not answer (no DNS) at the first registry request of the run (the closure POST, after the guard). The run goes on in direct mode: exit 0, the GitHub release lists, one warning on stderr also with --quiet, and `data.notes[]` has `{"kind":"registry-direct","registry","cause"}` (--json). The calls.log is a proposal built from the direct run (registry/rg2-default-registry run 2) after the failed POST; the order of the guard and the POST is as the code does it now.
